### Isolated Margin Mode (SDK v2.11.0+)

Isolated margin mode allows per-position margin isolation, limiting risk to the allocated collateral for each position. Users can hold positions in both cross and isolated margin modes simultaneously.

**Key SDK support:**
- **v2.11.0**: Initial isolated margin support
- **v2.12.0**: ISO/Cross margin labels on TradingView chart position lines
- **v3.1.0**: Fixed ISO max-out order rejection (reserves taker fee buffer)
