**Note:** The PnL social sharing card always displays the user's maximum account leverage setting, not the effective leverage of an individual position.

### Advanced Order Types

| Order Type | SDK Version | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Scaled Orders** | v2.4.1 | Multiple limit orders across a price range with customizable distribution |
